{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">下周五是中秋節，康文署及旅發局在維園一帶舉行綵燈會，免費入場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.18.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026tIfFMorG6s1789667881.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.18.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">夜幕低垂，華燈初上。一年一度的綵燈會，又回到維園。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.22.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uwd89fbXqJ1789667910.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.22.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">未到正日，月亮彎彎亦不必失望，可先賞「圓月」花燈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.34.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uC6MOboo241789667992.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.34.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">月亮有「加大版」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.21.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026FxAjifWHuV1789667903.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.21.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.20.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Io14KfDvxH1789667895.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.20.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.19.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Me0S4nrva91789667888.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.19.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將地道美食「放大」，小朋友快樂又會否加倍？</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">小朋友Sophie表示：「(最喜歡)香港食物花燈，有菠蘿包、魚蛋、哈哈笑，很可愛，我很喜歡。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.12.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026DflVnYOce71789667840.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.12.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.4.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ACnkDNgjEf1789667790.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.4.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.6.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263XzJbUMsBS1789667802.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.6.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.5.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202669eKreVuZd1789667796.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.5.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.7.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026DfB6j0QQPg1789667809.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.7.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首日亮燈，已吸引不少市民搶先「打卡」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.25.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026MnLWvUmZJ01789667930.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.25.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.10.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026IG9dn8cdci1789667828.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.10.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.9.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gyuJOMVG781789667822.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.9.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中秋的代表玉兔。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.13.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026YGUK3dc2t91789667847.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.13.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.8.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026GnIekBvVpV1789667815.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.8.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">加上大熊貓，可愛滿分。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.2.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026lDHIYWOyMQ1789667774.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.2.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當然少不了馬年的主角。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.38.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uQVKW7FUJg1789668019.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.38.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.37.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026MTIJdt25eu1789668012.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.37.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">袁小姐指：「感覺有驚喜。跟前年的不一樣，韶關深圳沒有這些，看到新聞就過來，因為內地氣氛，過年有、中秋沒有特別氣氛。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.3.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269xPo7dh4vi1789667781.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.3.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.46.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wevtEC8sET1789668667.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.46.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">唐女士稱：「每盞燈也這麼美，但若花燈上有提字更漂亮，例如花好月圓，有中國特色，好像元宵佳節，人們也會寫些提字的詩。我由天后入來，已經吸引到我走到盡頭，我會放上去(網上平台)，讓海外的人也可欣賞香港。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.26.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026I8OBdvUe8G1789667937.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.26.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">世界綵燈大街，人山人海。</span><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.27.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026JO3EufLsxP1789667944.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.27.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.29.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20265wgaLjyHuJ1789667958.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.29.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.30.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026QJfAhiBBPs1789667964.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.30.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">她想將香港的花燈分享到世界，旅發局亦將世界各地的特色綵燈，帶來維園一帶。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.1.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026T7e40ZaJLm1789667768.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.1.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">記者陳尚萱身處的世界綵燈大街，是今年綵燈會特色之一，首次匯聚世界各地，逾3,000盞特色綵燈。</span><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.31.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wxRfqa3mp31789667971.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.31.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">來自法國、德國、菲律賓等，20個國家及地區的綵燈，匯聚維園互相輝映。</span><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這條世界綵燈大街，集合法國、德國、菲律賓等，20個國家及地區的逾3,000盞世界特色綵燈，是一個很漂亮的打卡點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.39.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wOaIV5LKvj1789668026.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.39.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.36.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202663desAk2fN1789668006.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.36.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.33.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20266KWGkPehK11789667985.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.33.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旅發局首度舉行「國際中秋綵燈匯」，帶來國家非遺的南京秦淮燈彩。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.41.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026A4c2Kf6Hsi1789668039.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.41.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">文體旅局局長羅淑佩率先來欣賞花燈，感受節日氣氛。包括這個以香港大榕樹為靈感製作，約八米高的大型綵燈「樹影流光」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.44.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202682RvJb5ghT1789668060.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.44.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">穿上旗袍的羅淑佩，坐在綵燈前「擺靚甫士」打卡。</span><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.42.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026XiXSpCB9PS1789668047.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.42.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">羅淑佩到場內攤檔品嘗月餅。</span><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.43.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026FbiL7cY44a1789668054.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.43.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">羅淑佩表示綵燈會連同大坑舞火龍活動，加上商界各種中秋優惠，可讓市民、旅客感受香港魅力。</span><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一連11日的綵燈會，每晚約6時半會亮燈，直至晚上11時，而中秋節正日，則會延長至午夜12時。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.14.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026NVVkixuRMH1789667853.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.14.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.11.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026T6RpPFIKJU1789667835.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"MIDAUTUM.11.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"MIDAUTUM.17.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20265l7Kx7QmT01